<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 3.41%				    O/N = -----</p>
<p>	    T/N = 5.10%				    T/N = 1.27%</p>
<p>		   Sept 6, 1996			Sept 5, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.81%	1 month forward =  6.80%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.69%	2 month forward =  8.50%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.31%	3 month forward =  9.29%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  9.87%	4 month forward =  9.94%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.42%	5 month forward = 10.54%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.27%	6 month forward = 10.39%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
